    title: 'Flood of Federal Retirement Applications Hits OPM Backlog',
    excerpt: 'OPM backlog of pending retirement claims sees another massive spike in November 2025. Over 40,000 still pending.',
    category: 'FERS',
    author: 'david-fei',
    authorDisplay: 'David Fei, CFP®, ChFEBC℠, AIF®',
