    slug: 'opm-backlog-sees-spike-in-october-2025-amidst-shutdown',
    title: 'OPM Backlog Sees Spike in October 2025 Amidst Shutdown',
    excerpt: 'OPM Backlog of CSRS and FERS Retirement applications increases to over 20,000 in October 2025. Avergae monthly processing time continues to climb, delaying full pension checks for recent retirees.',
    category: 'FERS',
    author: 'david-fei',
