    slug: 'prep-for-surprise-exit-from-public-service-toolkit-for-federal-employees',
    title: 'Prep for Surprise Exit from Public Service: Toolkit for Federal Employees',
    excerpt: 'Be ready for an unexpected exit from federal government! Equip yourself with our toolkit for federal employees facing unexpected exits from public service. If you’re a federal worker, learn about reti',
    category: 'FERS',
