    title: 'Federal Retirement Benefits: FERS Annuity Tax Withholding Information',
    excerpt: 'Understand federal retirement benefits: FERS annuity tax withholding. Learn about the taxation of federal retirement income, and how to withhold federal income tax while still in service.',
    category: 'FERS',
    author: 'ben-derge',
