    slug: 'comprehensive-guide-to-2025-gs-pay-scale-adjustments',
    title: 'Deep Dive into 2025 GS Pay Scale Adjustments',
    excerpt: 'Deep Dive into 2025 GS Pay Scale Adjustments   Introduction: Why the 2025 GS Pay Scale Matters for Your Take-Home Pay & Retirement For federal employees, even a modest pay bump can have ripple effects',
    category: 'FERS',
