    slug: '2025-irmaa-brackets-discover-new-medicare-premium-thresholds',
    title: '2025 IRMAA Brackets: Discover New Medicare Premium Thresholds',
    excerpt: '2025 IRMAA Brackets: Discover New Medicare Premium Thresholds   Introduction   Have you noticed how healthcare expenses seem to keep creeping up just when you’re planning to step away from the workfor',
    category: 'FEHB & Medicare',
