    slug: '2024-tsp-fund-performance-c-fund-leads-strong-year-for-thrift-savings-plan',
    title: '2024 TSP Fund Performance: C Fund Leads Strong Year for Thrift Savings Plan',
    excerpt: '2024 TSP Fund Performance: the C Fund has grown almost 30% year-to-date. Federal employees: stay informed with our thrift savings plan monthly update about your retirement investment savings.',
    category: 'FERS',
    author: 'ben-derge',
