    slug: 'fers-and-csrs-the-best-dates-for-federal-employees-to-retire-in-2025',
    title: 'FERS and CSRS: The Best Dates for Federal Employees to Retire in 2025',
    excerpt: 'Discover the best date for federal employees to retire in 2025. Maximize your FERS or CSRS benefits as you plan your transition to retirement The Best Dates for Federal Employees to Retire in 2025: A ',
    category: 'FERS',
    author: 'ben-derge',
    authorDisplay: 'Ben Derge',
