    title: 'FERS Retirement Quick Guide – What to Expect Post-Application',
    excerpt: 'FERS Retirement Quick Guide – What to Expect Post-Application Retiring from federal service can be a complex process, but with the right knowledge and preparation, you can smoothly navigate through it',
