    slug: 'reverse-mortgage',
    title: 'Reverse Mortgages: How They Work and How to Avoid Pitfalls',
    excerpt: 'Reverse Mortgages: How They Work and How to Avoid Pitfalls Reverse mortgages offer a unique financial solution for seniors, allowing them to tap into the equity of their homes while still retaining ow',
    category: 'FERS',
    author: 'brennan-rhule',
    authorDisplay: 'Brennan Rhule, CFP®, ChFEBC℠, AIF®',
